    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Henry Kee & Son delighted to present to the market this pristine, three-bedroom bungalow. Occupying an elevated plot overlooking the River Finn and set in the heart of an area known as Glenfin which is located on the fringe of the Blue Stack Mountains. Internal accommodation comprises of sitting room, sunroom, kitchen, three bedrooms (one of which is en-suite) plus family bathroom. A detached garage at the rear plus mature landscaped grounds all combine to create a very appealing private family home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Three bedroom detached home.<br><br>\nSitting Room - 4.45m x 3.5m <br>Marble fireplace with cream stove. \nLarge south and west facing corner window with patio door.\nPainted timber floor. \nContains hotpress. <br><br><br>\nKitchen - 5.2m x 2.5m <br>High and low level kitchen units (tiled between) with breakfast counter. \nGas hob, electric oven - included. \nMicrowave - included. \nIntegrated fridge/freezer - included.\nWashing machine and tumbledryer - included.\nBelfast sink.\nFloor tiled. \nDouble aspect windows. \nPVC back door with glass panel. <br><br><br>\nSunroom - 3.7m x 3.5m <br>Accessed from sitting room.\nSouth, west and north facing windows. \nTongue and groove pine ceiling. \nPainted timber flooring. \nOrnate ceiling light. <br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 3.8m x 3.6m (including en-suite) <br>Six-door built-in wardrobe unit.\nPainted timber flooring. \n\nEn-Suite:\nWC, WHB and quadrant shower. \nFloor and walls fully tiled. \nChrome heated towel rail. \nStorage cupboard underneath WHB.\nRecessed ceiling lights. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 3.8m x 2.9m <br>Built-in wardrobe. \nSouth facing window. \nPainted timber floor. \nCurtains and blinds. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 3.5m x 3m <br>Painted timber floor. \nSouth-facing window.\nCurtains and blinds. <br><br><br>\nBathroom - 3m x 2.5m <br>WC, WHB (Glass and chrome design) and free-standing bath. \nLarge walk-in shower unit. \nFloor and walls fully tiled. \nChrome heated towel rail.\nRecessed lighting. \nMirror fitted over WHB.<br><br><br>\nGarage - 8m x 3m <br>Roller vehicle door. \nPedestrian door. \nWindow. \nContains WC and WHB.\nOil tank in garage. \nPump for deep bore well. <br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Scenic location. \nMature grounds with numerous fruit trees. \nPrivate water supply for a deep bore well. \nCloghan Village with number amenities within 3km distance. \nBright and airy throughout internally."
      },
